== JD Sports Fashion: I. Goods Sold Through Retail StoresIn the case of goods sold through retail stores, revenue is recognised when goods are sold, meaning theperformance obligation of the transaction has been satisfied, less provision for returns, and discounts applied. A separate right of return asset is recognised. Accumulated experience is used to estimate and provide for such returns at the time of the sale. Therefund liability due to customers on return of their goods isrecognised in a separate refund liability category. Retail sales are typically paid by cash, debit card or credit card. For online sales, performance obligations are deemed to be satisfied when the goods are delivered to the customer.For online click and collect orders, where the customer pays online but collects in store, performance obligations are deemed to be satisfied when the goods are collected by the customer.
